const NAV=[['accueil','⌂','Accueil'],['journal','◐','Journal'],['mesures','⌁','Mesures'],['defis','◇','Défis'],['sport','↗','Sport'],['agenda','▦','Agenda']],KEY='mon-equilibre-v2';
const state={daily:{},journal:{},measures:[],goals:[],sports:[],appointments:[],calendarDeletions:[],...(JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(KEY)||'null')||{})},$=s=>document.querySelector(s),$$=s=>[...document.querySelectorAll(s)],today=new Date().toISOString().slice(0,10);
const safe=s=>{const e=document.createElement('span');e.textContent=s??'';return e.innerHTML},nice=d=>new Intl.DateTimeFormat('fr-FR',{day:'numeric',month:'short',year:'numeric'}).format(new Date(d+'T12:00:00'));
const moodIcon=value=>({Difficile:'😟',Correcte:'😐',Mitigée:'😐',Réparatrice:'😊',Bonne:'😊'}[value]||'—');
const recurrenceLabels={daily:'Tous les jours',weekly:'Chaque semaine',monthly:'Chaque mois'};
function goalPeriod(date,recurrence){if(recurrence==='daily')return date;if(recurrence==='monthly')return date.slice(0,7);if(recurrence==='weekly'){const d=new Date(date+'T12:00:00'),day=(d.getDay()+6)%7;d.setDate(d.getDate()-day);return d.toISOString().slice(0,10)}return null}
function goalDone(g){return g.recurrence&&g.recurrence!=='none'?g.lastCompletedPeriod===goalPeriod(today,g.recurrence):!!g.done}
function goalCheckLabel(g,done){if(!g.recurrence||g.recurrence==='none')return done?'Terminé':'En cours';const period={daily:"aujourd’hui",weekly:'cette semaine',monthly:'ce mois'}[g.recurrence];return done?`Fait ${period}`:`À faire ${period}`}
function save(){localStorage.setItem(KEY,JSON.stringify(state));$('#savedMsg').classList.add('show');setTimeout(()=>$('#savedMsg').classList.remove('show'),900)}
const nav=NAV.map(([id,i,l])=>`<button class="nav-item ${id==='accueil'?'active':''}" data-go="${id}"><span class="nav-icon">${i}</span><span>${l}</span></button>`).join('');$('.desktop-nav').innerHTML=nav;$('.mobile-nav').innerHTML=nav;
function go(id){$$('.view').forEach(v=>v.classList.toggle('active',v.id===id));$$('.nav-item').forEach(n=>n.classList.toggle('active',n.dataset.go===id));$('#pageTitle').textContent=$('#'+id).dataset.title;scrollTo({top:0,behavior:'smooth'});render()}
document.addEventListener('click',e=>{const g=e.target.closest('[data-go]');if(g)go(g.dataset.go)});$('#todayLabel').textContent=new Intl.DateTimeFormat('fr-FR',{weekday:'long',day:'numeric',month:'long'}).format(new Date());
function daily(){return state.daily[today]??={water:0,cola:0}}document.addEventListener('click',e=>{const b=e.target.closest('[data-count]');if(!b)return;daily()[b.dataset.count]=Math.max(0,(daily()[b.dataset.count]||0)+ +b.dataset.delta);save();renderHome()});
$$('#quickMood button').forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>{(state.journal[today]??={}).day=b.dataset.mood;save();renderHome()});
function renderHome(){const d=daily(),next=state.appointments.filter(a=>a.date>=today).sort((a,b)=>(a.date+a.time).localeCompare(b.date+b.time))[0];$('#waterCount').textContent=d.water;$('#colaCount').textContent=d.cola;$('#lastWeight').textContent=state.measures[0]?.weight?state.measures[0].weight+' kg':'—';$('#activeGoals').textContent=state.goals.filter(g=>(g.recurrence&&g.recurrence!=='none')||!g.done).length;$('#sportMonth').textContent=state.sports.filter(s=>s.date.startsWith(today.slice(0,7))).length;$('#nextAppointment').innerHTML=next?`<span>${safe(next.category)}</span><strong>${safe(next.title)}</strong><small>${nice(next.date)}${next.time?' · '+safe(next.time):''}</small>`:'<span>Agenda</span><strong>Aucun rendez-vous prévu</strong><small>Ajouter un moment pour vous</small>';$$('#quickMood button').forEach(b=>b.classList.toggle('selected',b.dataset.mood===state.journal[today]?.day))}
let journalDay=today;$('#journalDate').value=today;$('#journalDate').onchange=e=>{journalDay=e.target.value;renderJournal()};$('#journalToday').onclick=()=>{journalDay=today;$('#journalDate').value=today;renderJournal()};
function choices(id,key){$(id).onclick=e=>{const b=e.target.closest('[data-value]');if(!b)return;(state.journal[journalDay]??={})[key]=b.dataset.value;$$(id+' button').forEach(x=>x.classList.toggle('selected',x===b))}}choices('#nightQuality','night');choices('#dayQuality','day');
function renderJournalHistory(){const days=Object.entries(state.journal).filter(([,j])=>j.night||j.day||j.nightNote||j.dayNote).sort(([a],[b])=>b.localeCompare(a));$('#journalHistory').innerHTML=days.length?days.map(([date,j])=>`<button class="journal-history-item ${date===journalDay?'active':''}" data-journal-day="${date}"><strong>${date===today?'Aujourd’hui':new Intl.DateTimeFormat('fr-FR',{day:'numeric',month:'short',year:'numeric'}).format(new Date(date+'T12:00:00'))}</strong><span class="journal-history-moods"><i aria-label="Nuit : ${safe(j.night||'non renseignée')}"><b>🌙</b>${moodIcon(j.night)}</i><i aria-label="Journée : ${safe(j.day||'non renseignée')}"><b>☀️</b>${moodIcon(j.day)}</i></span></button>`).join(''):'<p class="journal-history-empty">Vos journées apparaîtront ici après leur enregistrement.</p>'}
$('#journalHistory').onclick=e=>{const button=e.target.closest('[data-journal-day]');if(!button)return;journalDay=button.dataset.journalDay;$('#journalDate').value=journalDay;renderJournal();scrollTo({top:$('#journal').offsetTop,behavior:'smooth'})};
function renderJournal(){const j=state.journal[journalDay]||{};$('#nightNote').value=j.nightNote||'';$('#dayNote').value=j.dayNote||'';$$('#nightQuality button').forEach(b=>b.classList.toggle('selected',b.dataset.value===j.night));$$('#dayQuality button').forEach(b=>b.classList.toggle('selected',b.dataset.value===j.day));renderJournalHistory()}$('#saveJournal').onclick=()=>{const j=state.journal[journalDay]??={},button=$('#saveJournal');j.nightNote=$('#nightNote').value;j.dayNote=$('#dayNote').value;save();renderJournalHistory();button.textContent='Journée enregistrée ✓';setTimeout(()=>button.textContent='Enregistrer cette journée',1600)};
function modal(open,dialog,form,fn){
  const dlg=$(dialog),frm=$(form);
  $(open).onclick=()=>{frm.reset();if(frm.elements.date)frm.elements.date.value=today;dlg.showModal()};
  document.querySelectorAll(dialog+' [value="cancel"]').forEach(button=>{
    button.type='button';
    button.onclick=e=>{e.preventDefault();dlg.close()}
  });
  frm.onsubmit=e=>{e.preventDefault();fn(new FormData(e.target));save();dlg.close();render()}
};
modal('#openMeasure','#measureDialog','#measureForm',f=>{const x=Object.fromEntries(f);['weight','waist','hips','chest','thigh'].forEach(k=>x[k]=x[k]?+x[k]:null);state.measures.unshift(x);state.measures.sort((a,b)=>b.date.localeCompare(a.date))});modal('#openGoal','#goalDialog','#goalForm',f=>state.goals.unshift({title:f.get('title'),theme:f.get('theme'),recurrence:f.get('recurrence'),deadline:f.get('deadline'),reason:f.get('reason'),done:false,lastCompletedPeriod:null}));modal('#openSport','#sportDialog','#sportForm',f=>{state.sports.unshift(Object.fromEntries(f));state.sports.sort((a,b)=>b.date.localeCompare(a.date))});
modal('#openAppointment','#appointmentDialog','#appointmentForm',f=>{const item={...Object.fromEntries(f),id:crypto.randomUUID?.()||String(Date.now()),calendarDirty:true,googleEventId:''};state.appointments.push(item);state.appointments.sort((a,b)=>(a.date+a.time).localeCompare(b.date+b.time));if(calendarSync.token)setTimeout(syncAllCalendarAppointments,0)});
const empty=(a,b)=>`<div class="empty"><span>＋</span><p>${a}</p><small>${b}</small></div>`;
function renderMeasures(){const l=state.measures,x=l[0],o=l.at(-1);$('#mWeight').textContent=x?.weight?x.weight+' kg':'—';$('#mWaist').textContent=x?.waist?x.waist+' cm':'—';$('#mHips').textContent=x?.hips?x.hips+' cm':'—';const d=x?.weight&&o?.weight&&l.length>1?x.weight-o.weight:null;$('#mChange').textContent=d===null?'—':`${d>0?'+':''}${d.toFixed(1)} kg`;$('#measureList').innerHTML=l.map((m,i)=>`<div class="data-row"><div><strong>${nice(m.date)}</strong><small>${[['Poids',m.weight,'kg'],['Taille',m.waist,'cm'],['Hanches',m.hips,'cm'],['Poitrine',m.chest,'cm'],['Cuisse',m.thigh,'cm']].filter(x=>x[1]).map(x=>x.join(' ')).join(' · ')}</small></div><button data-rm="${i}">×</button></div>`).join('')||empty('Aucun relevé','Ajoutez une première mesure quand vous le souhaitez.')}
function renderGoals(){$('#goalList').innerHTML=state.goals.map((g,i)=>{const done=goalDone(g),overdue=g.deadline&&g.deadline<today&&!done;return `<article class="card goal-card ${done?'completed':''} ${overdue?'overdue':''}"><div class="goal-tags">${g.theme?`<span class="goal-theme">${safe(g.theme)}</span>`:''}${g.recurrence&&g.recurrence!=='none'?`<span class="goal-repeat">↻ ${recurrenceLabels[g.recurrence]}</span>`:''}</div><label><input type="checkbox" data-goal="${i}" ${done?'checked':''}> ${goalCheckLabel(g,done)}</label><h3>${safe(g.title)}</h3>${g.deadline?`<div class="goal-deadline">${overdue?'Échéance dépassée':'Échéance'} · ${nice(g.deadline)}</div>`:''}${g.reason?`<p>${safe(g.reason)}</p>`:''}<button data-rg="${i}">Supprimer</button></article>`}).join('')||empty('Aucun défi','Créez un objectif qui compte pour vous.')}
function renderSports(){$('#sportList').innerHTML=state.sports.map((s,i)=>`<div class="data-row"><span class="sport-badge">↗</span><div><strong>${safe(s.activity)}</strong><small>${nice(s.date)}${s.duration?' · '+s.duration+' min':''} · ${safe(s.feeling)}${s.note?' · '+safe(s.note):''}</small></div><button data-rs="${i}">×</button></div>`).join('')||empty('Aucune séance notée','Votre prochaine séance trouvera sa place ici.')}
function renderAppointments(){const upcoming=state.appointments.map((a,i)=>({...a,i})).filter(a=>a.date>=today),past=state.appointments.map((a,i)=>({...a,i})).filter(a=>a.date<today).reverse(),rows=list=>list.map(a=>`<div class="data-row appointment-row"><span class="appointment-date"><b>${new Date(a.date+'T12:00:00').getDate()}</b>${new Intl.DateTimeFormat('fr-FR',{month:'short'}).format(new Date(a.date+'T12:00:00'))}</span><div><strong>${safe(a.title)}</strong><small>${safe(a.category)}${a.time?' · '+safe(a.time):''}${a.note?' · '+safe(a.note):''}</small></div><button data-ra="${a.i}" aria-label="Supprimer ce rendez-vous">×</button></div>`).join('');$('#appointmentList').innerHTML=rows(upcoming)||empty('Aucun rendez-vous à venir','Ajoutez un moment consacré à votre bien-être.');$('#pastAppointmentList').innerHTML=rows(past)||empty('Aucun rendez-vous passé','Votre historique apparaîtra ici.')}
document.addEventListener('change',e=>{if(e.target.dataset.goal!==undefined){const g=state.goals[+e.target.dataset.goal];if(g.recurrence&&g.recurrence!=='none')g.lastCompletedPeriod=e.target.checked?goalPeriod(today,g.recurrence):null;else g.done=e.target.checked;save();render()}});document.addEventListener('click',e=>{for(const [a,k] of [['rm','measures'],['rg','goals'],['rs','sports'],['ra','appointments']])if(e.target.dataset[a]!==undefined){const index=+e.target.dataset[a],item=state[k][index];if(a==='ra'&&item?.googleEventId)state.calendarDeletions.push({googleEventId:item.googleEventId});state[k].splice(index,1);save();render();if(a==='ra'&&calendarSync.token)setTimeout(syncAllCalendarAppointments,0)}});
const calendarSync={auth:null,authSdk:null,provider:null,user:null,token:'',expiresAt:0,syncing:false},calendarAccessKey='mon-equilibre-google-calendar';
function setCalendarStatus(message,state=''){const box=$('#calendarSyncStatus'),connected=calendarSync.token&&Date.now()<calendarSync.expiresAt;box.className='calendar-sync-status '+state;box.querySelector('b').textContent=message;$('#calendarSyncButton').disabled=!connected||calendarSync.syncing;$('#calendarConnectButton').textContent=connected?'Renouveler l’accès Google':'Connecter Google Agenda'}
function rememberCalendarAccess(){if(!calendarSync.token||!calendarSync.user)return;localStorage.setItem(calendarAccessKey,JSON.stringify({token:calendarSync.token,expiresAt:calendarSync.expiresAt,uid:calendarSync.user.uid}))}
function restoreCalendarAccess(user){try{const saved=JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(calendarAccessKey)||'null');if(!saved?.token||saved.uid!==user.uid||saved.expiresAt<=Date.now()+15000)return false;calendarSync.token=saved.token;calendarSync.expiresAt=saved.expiresAt;return true}catch{return false}}
function forgetCalendarAccess(){calendarSync.token='';calendarSync.expiresAt=0;localStorage.removeItem(calendarAccessKey)}
async function calendarApi(path,options={}){if(!calendarSync.token||Date.now()>=calendarSync.expiresAt){forgetCalendarAccess();setCalendarStatus('Accès expiré — reconnectez Google','');throw new Error('calendar-auth-required')}const response=await fetch('https://www.googleapis.com/calendar/v3/calendars/primary/'+path,{...options,headers:{Authorization:'Bearer '+calendarSync.token,'Content-Type':'application/json',...(options.headers||{})}});if(response.status===401){forgetCalendarAccess();setCalendarStatus('Accès expiré — reconnectez Google','');throw new Error('calendar-auth-required')}if(!response.ok){let message='';try{message=(await response.json())?.error?.message||''}catch{}throw new Error(message||'Google Agenda : erreur '+response.status)}return response.status===204?null:response.json()}
function googleCalendarPayload(item){const description=[item.category,item.note].filter(Boolean).join('\n');if(item.time){const start=new Date(item.date+'T'+item.time+':00'),end=new Date(start.getTime()+60*60*1000);return{summary:item.title,description,start:{dateTime:start.toISOString()},end:{dateTime:end.toISOString()}}}const end=new Date(item.date+'T12:00:00');end.setDate(end.getDate()+1);return{summary:item.title,description,start:{date:item.date},end:{date:end.toISOString().slice(0,10)}}}
async function syncAppointmentToGoogle(item){const payload=googleCalendarPayload(item);let event;if(item.googleEventId){try{event=await calendarApi('events/'+encodeURIComponent(item.googleEventId),{method:'PUT',body:JSON.stringify(payload)})}catch(error){item.googleEventId='';event=await calendarApi('events',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify(payload)})}}else event=await calendarApi('events',{method:'POST',body:JSON.stringify(payload)});item.googleEventId=event.id;item.googleEventLink=event.htmlLink||'';item.googleSyncedAt=new Date().toISOString();item.calendarDirty=false;save()}
async function syncAllCalendarAppointments(){if(calendarSync.syncing)return;calendarSync.syncing=true;setCalendarStatus('Synchronisation en cours…','syncing');let synced=0,deleted=0;try{for(const pending of [...state.calendarDeletions]){await calendarApi('events/'+encodeURIComponent(pending.googleEventId),{method:'DELETE'});state.calendarDeletions=state.calendarDeletions.filter(x=>x!==pending);deleted++}for(const item of state.appointments.filter(a=>a.date>=today&&(a.calendarDirty||!a.googleEventId))){item.id||=(crypto.randomUUID?.()||String(Date.now()+Math.random()));await syncAppointmentToGoogle(item);synced++}save();setCalendarStatus(synced||deleted?`${synced} rendez-vous synchronisé${synced>1?'s':''}${deleted?' · '+deleted+' suppression'+(deleted>1?'s':''):''}`:'Tout est synchronisé','connected')}catch(error){console.error(error);if(error.message!=='calendar-auth-required')setCalendarStatus('Synchronisation impossible — réessayez','error')}finally{calendarSync.syncing=false;$('#calendarSyncButton').disabled=!(calendarSync.token&&Date.now()<calendarSync.expiresAt)}}
async function connectGoogleCalendar(){if(calendarSync.syncing)return;const button=$('#calendarConnectButton');button.disabled=true;setCalendarStatus('Ouverture de Google…','syncing');try{if(!calendarSync.auth||!calendarSync.provider)throw new Error('Google indisponible');const result=calendarSync.auth.currentUser?await calendarSync.authSdk.reauthenticateWithPopup(calendarSync.auth.currentUser,calendarSync.provider):await calendarSync.authSdk.signInWithPopup(calendarSync.auth,calendarSync.provider),credential=calendarSync.authSdk.GoogleAuthProvider.credentialFromResult(result);if(!credential?.accessToken)throw new Error('Autorisation Agenda non reçue');calendarSync.user=calendarSync.auth.currentUser;calendarSync.token=credential.accessToken;calendarSync.expiresAt=Date.now()+50*60*1000;rememberCalendarAccess();setCalendarStatus('Accès Google autorisé','connected');await syncAllCalendarAppointments()}catch(error){console.error(error);setCalendarStatus(error.code==='auth/popup-closed-by-user'?'Connexion annulée':error.code==='auth/popup-blocked'?'Autorisez la fenêtre Google puis réessayez':'Connexion Google Agenda impossible','error')}finally{button.disabled=false}}
async function setupGoogleCalendar(){try{const version='12.18.0',[appSdk,authSdk]=await Promise.all([import(`https://www.gstatic.com/firebasejs/${version}/firebase-app.js`),import(`https://www.gstatic.com/firebasejs/${version}/firebase-auth.js`)]),firebaseConfig={apiKey:'AIzaSyBsfDBR2oB20UEFbOxjFFnEH5r-6uKX0lI',authDomain:'mon-organisateur-lg.firebaseapp.com',projectId:'mon-organisateur-lg',appId:'1:1080473447467:web:0a9752f88cffef8f06ce6e'},app=appSdk.getApps().length?appSdk.getApp():appSdk.initializeApp(firebaseConfig),auth=authSdk.getAuth(app),provider=new authSdk.GoogleAuthProvider();provider.addScope('https://www.googleapis.com/auth/calendar.events');calendarSync.auth=auth;calendarSync.authSdk=authSdk;calendarSync.provider=provider;authSdk.onAuthStateChanged(auth,user=>{calendarSync.user=user;if(!user){forgetCalendarAccess();setCalendarStatus('Agenda non connecté','');return}setCalendarStatus(restoreCalendarAccess(user)?'Accès Google mémorisé':'Prêt à connecter Google',calendarSync.token?'connected':'')})}catch(error){console.error(error);setCalendarStatus('Google Agenda indisponible','error');$('#calendarConnectButton').disabled=true}}
$('#calendarConnectButton').onclick=connectGoogleCalendar;$('#calendarSyncButton').onclick=syncAllCalendarAppointments;
